# WorkNest Supabase Configuration
# Optional: connect a Supabase project to store accounts and user-created data in the cloud.
# Without these values, WorkNest runs locally in the browser (accounts and data persist on this device only).
# To enable cloud sync: run supabase/schema.sql in your project, then paste your Project URL and anon key below.
#
# First-time account creation is verified with a 6-digit email OTP when Supabase is configured:
#   - Supabase -> Authentication -> Providers -> Email: turn "Confirm email" ON.
#   - Supabase -> Authentication -> Email Templates -> "Confirm signup": include {{ .Code }}
#     so the email carries a 6-digit code (WorkNest falls back to the link if it does not).
# Vite only reads this file at startup - restart `npm run dev` after editing it.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
